99
00:06:24,041 --> 00:06:27,680
port tanks. When the vessel is ready to

100
00:06:27,681 --> 00:06:32,520
discharge, hydraulic pumps create a vacuum inside the steel pipes,

101
00:06:32,521 --> 00:06:37,320
